DISCLAIMER
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is a reference implementation and a reproducible demonstration.
It is not production software and not a certified O-RAN product.

  * Numbers produced by the demo (wake latency, management plane round trip)
    are laptop simulation figures and are labelled as such.
  * The mock O-RU, its radio simulation and its power model are illustrative.
    Energy figures are relative comparisons under a stated model. They are not
    measurements.
  * The physics twin ships with generic 3GPP default parameters and reports the
    rung "simulation, generic 3GPP defaults (uncalibrated)" on every response.
  * The data that ships is synthetic.
